    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> —</p><p>By expending an amount of MGP as a free action after rolling for initiative but before the turn order commences, you assign one visible creature as the anchor, placing them last in the initiative order. The target may attempt a Will save to negate this effect. This gambit expends an amount of MGP equal to the affected creature's initiative value. You may expend more MGP than your gambler level when using this gambit, but it cannot be used at the same time as the Ante gambit.</p>",
